    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/5d89a56ce89e920db0c502272724fa6e.avif?t=1731486222\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Flying Peep, you immerse yourself in a world of intimate secrets and hidden desires. You control a small firefly that lights up the path in a dark room, searching for a hidden girl. This game gives you the sensation of peeping at the girl, watching her every move while remaining unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/50a0e37085b6244ba591d23056cc9592.poster.avif?t=1731486222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/50a0e37085b6244ba591d23056cc9592.webm?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/50a0e37085b6244ba591d23056cc9592.mp4?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The firefly is the only source of light in the room, and its task is to find specific points on the girl's body. Each discovered point triggers soft, sensual sounds from the girl, emphasizing the intimate nature of your search. These sounds become more pronounced as you approach the final point, which delivers a special pleasure and serves as the climax of your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/02615a203e5bf11288e1be9d24809b1e.poster.avif?t=1731486222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/02615a203e5bf11288e1be9d24809b1e.webm?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/02615a203e5bf11288e1be9d24809b1e.mp4?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It\u2019s important to remember that in the dark room, you can\u2019t touch anything except the required points on the girl. One wrong move can cost you your life. Your skill lies in precision, caution, and attention to the smallest details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new level, the girl appears in more revealing outfits, intensifying your desire to continue the game and explore further. After collecting all the points in a level, the firefly turns on the lights in the room, allowing you to fully appreciate the girl\u2019s beauty before moving on to the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/41a615a2bafa839cbe0e8bdbdaa7191b.poster.avif?t=1731486222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/41a615a2bafa839cbe0e8bdbdaa7191b.webm?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/41a615a2bafa839cbe0e8bdbdaa7191b.mp4?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sensual Atmosphere: The game focuses on aesthetics and sensuality, creating a mood of secret observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sound Effects: Each discovered point is accompanied by pleasant sounds that enhance the erotic effect, especially the final point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interactive Gameplay: Masterful control of light and precise interaction with the environment are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/633fb0703c7030ee0919eeb75c8254e2.avif?t=1731486222\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Progressive Eroticism: With each level, the girl appears in more revealing outfits, keeping the player's interest high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Aesthetics and Style: The minimalist design highlights the beauty of light and shadow, making each level unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Flying Peep is a game for those who appreciate subtlety and sensuality in simple yet captivating mechanics. Play to enjoy an intimate adventure, exploring dark corners and uncovering the beauty hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/9efe6fba23c5b0f09d50dae77a686f73.poster.avif?t=1731486222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/9efe6fba23c5b0f09d50dae77a686f73.webm?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214470/extras/9efe6fba23c5b0f09d50dae77a686f73.mp4?t=1731486222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
